-- What GAMMA's use scripts give back when a player uses an item, made by the
-- server (engine: Actor_Events GEG_PLAYER_ITEM_EAT -> server_item_used, with
-- db.actor bound to that player, after the server applied the item).
--
-- Before: those scripts ran only on the player's client, where items cannot
-- be created and money cannot change (the server owns both), and the server
-- applied the item without them. So a chocolate bar left no second half, a
-- bolts pack no bolts, a used medical syringe no empty syringe, a "multiuse_r"
-- item (meant to keep its uses) lost one, and money items vanished without
-- adding money. Same rules as itms_manager / item_money:
--   chocolate           -> chocolate_p
--   empty_syringe_items -> e_syringe (items\settings\itms_manager.ltx)
--   bolts_pack          -> 20-30 bolts
--   multiuse_r          -> the use comes back (uses + 1 up to max)
--   money (kind)        -> its amount (or a random one in its range)
-- Mines/IEDs, scopes, cooking and map kits keep their own client state and
-- are not handled here.

local syringe_items

local function empty_syringe(sec)
	if not syringe_items then
		syringe_items = {}
		local ini = itms_manager and itms_manager.ini_manager or ini_file("items\\settings\\itms_manager.ltx")
		local n = ini and ini:section_exist("empty_syringe_items") and ini:line_count("empty_syringe_items") or 0
		for i = 0, n - 1 do
			local _, id = ini:r_line_ex("empty_syringe_items", i, "", "")
			if id and ini_sys:section_exist(id) then syringe_items[id] = true end
		end
	end
	return syringe_items[sec] == true
end

local function give(actor, sec, count)
	for i = 1, count or 1 do alife_create_item(sec, actor) end
end

function used(actor_id, item_id, sec)
	local actor = db.actor
	if not (actor and actor:id() == actor_id and actor:alive()) then return end
	if actor.has_info and actor:has_info("actor_made_wish_for_riches") then return end
	if sec == "chocolate" then
		give(actor, "chocolate_p")
	elseif sec == "bolts_pack" then
		give(actor, "bolt", math.random(20, 30))
	elseif empty_syringe(sec) then
		give(actor, "e_syringe")
	end
	if IsItem("multiuse_r", sec) then
		local obj = level.object_by_id(item_id)
		local uses, max_uses = obj and obj:get_remaining_uses(), obj and obj:get_max_uses()
		if uses and max_uses and uses < max_uses then obj:set_remaining_uses(uses + 1) end
	end
	local amount = IsItem("money", sec)
	if type(amount) == "table" and amount[1] then
		local low = math.floor(tonumber(amount[1]) or 10)
		local money = amount[2] and math.random(low, math.floor(tonumber(amount[2]) or 30)) or low
		actor:give_money(money)
		printf("[Lost Zone] %s used %s: +%s RU", tostring(netcoop_actor_login and netcoop_actor_login(actor_id) or actor_id), sec, money)
	end
end
